# Docusaurus
.docusaurus/
build/
node_modules/

# Pulled docs (generated by pull-docs.mjs)
docs/getting-started/
docs/architecture/*
docs/features/*
docs/extensions/
docs/skills/

# TypeDoc auto-generated
docs/api/
# Pages written in this repository (the manifest's siteDoc entries); the build does not generate them.
!docs/architecture/skills-vs-tools-vs-extensions.md
!docs/features/citation-verification.md
!docs/features/llm-output-validation.md

# Internal planning content — never publish (see CLAUDE.md)
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
docs/specs/
docs/plans/
docs/internal/
docs/audits/
docs/STEP_*.md
docs/PHASE_*.md
docs/STAGE_*.md
docs/SESSION_*.md
docs/HANDOFF*.md
docs/FINDINGS*.md
docs/*-v[0-9]*-plan*.md
docs/*-v[0-9]*-design*.md
docs/*-plan-phase*.md

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# macOS
.DS_Store
